msgstr ""
"WAL 文件来自不同的数据库系统: WAL 文件中的数据库系统标识符为 %llu，"
"pg_control 中的数据库系统标识符为 %llu"

#: xlogreader.c:877
#, c-format
msgid ""
"WAL file is from different database system: incorrect segment size in page "
