"已设置 BKPIMAGE_HAS_HOLE，但 %4$X/%5$X 处的空洞偏移量为 %1$u，长度为 %2$u，块"
"镜像长度为 %3$u"

#: xlogreader.c:1365
#, c-format
msgid "BKPIMAGE_HAS_HOLE not set, but hole offset %u length %u at %X/%X"
msgstr ""
"未设置 BKPIMAGE_HAS_HOLE，但 %3$X/%4$X 处的空洞偏移量为 %1$u，长度为 %2$u"

#: xlogreader.c:1380
#, c-format
msgid "BKPIMAGE_IS_COMPRESSED set, but block image length %u at %X/%X"
msgstr "已设置 BKPIMAGE_IS_COMPRESSED，但 %2$X/%3$X 处的块镜像长度为 %1$u"

#: xlogreader.c:1395
#, c-format
msgid ""
"neither BKPIMAGE_HAS_HOLE nor BKPIMAGE_IS_COMPRESSED set, but block image "
